Package: geomix
Title: GeoMix: A Bayesian Framework for Stratigraphic and Geotechnical Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bradley", "Wakefield", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "TODO"))
Description: Reproducible research code for the GeoMix paper. GeoMix is a
    fully Bayesian hierarchical framework for jointly inferring geological
    stratigraphy and geotechnical properties from seismic and geotechnical data.
